OL,3,GNEWSA'Passionate collector' selling
OL,4,AChurchill VE Day item
OL,5,
OL,6,FA microphone used by Winston Churchill
OL,7,Fto deliver a speech on VE Day in 1945
OL,8,Fis to be sold at auction.
OL,10,FIt is believed the Grampian radio
OL,11,Fmicrophone was used in one of four
OL,12,Fspeeches Churchill made on 8 May 1945,
OL,13,Fwhen the surrender of Nazi Germany was
OL,14,Fdeclared.
OL,16,FAuctioneer Liz Poole said the unique
OL,17,Fpiece comes from a "passionate
OL,18,Fcollector of items associated with
OL,19,FChurchill over many decades".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
